\addlinespace
14B & AAVE & $-0.015$ & $+0.003$ & $0.018$ & $[-0.05, 0.09]$ & $0.312$ \\
14B & Indian & $-0.012$ & $+0.004$ & $0.016$ & $[-0.04, 0.08]$ & $0.335$ \\
